      "purpose": "ILE RPG module (NOMAIN) that is part of the STRPREPRC pre-processor tool. It provides exported procedures for managing an event file (EVFEVENT) used by RDi/SEU error feedback: prepareEventFile, openEventFile, writeEventFile, and closeEventFile. It reads job log entries, filters ignored message IDs via a keyed physical file (STRPRE2), resolves source line numbers from message substitution variables, and writes compiler error records to the event file. Uses EXTPROC prototypes, /COPY includes for prototypes and APIs (QMHRTVM, EVFEVENT, JOBLOG), and pre-compiler directives for CRTRPGMOD.",
